Then, she uses twice as much oil as salt. Since salt is "y", oil would be 2y. 

Also, she uses twice as much salt as zest. Since zest is "x", salt is 2x. So here, we have two expressions for salt: one is "y" and the other is "2x". Therefore, y = 2x. 

