### Step 2: Calculate Saskay’s lifting ability

**Saskay** can lift a mountain **12 times higher** than **Pompei**.

$$
\text{Saskay’s capacity} = 12 \times (\text{Pompei's capacity}) = 12 \times 1 = 12 \text{ inches}
$$

