#### Cost of green food
$$
3 \text{ baskets} \times 25 \text{ dollars} = 75 \text{ dollars}
$$

#### Cost of red food (after discount)
$$
3 \text{ baskets} \times 16 \text{ dollars} = 48 \text{ dollars}
$$

---

### Step 3: Add the costs together

$$
\text{Total cost} = 75 + 48 = 123 \text{ dollars}
$$

---

### Final Answer:
$$
\boxed{123}
$$

