Next, we calculate the number of hours he works in a week. He works 8 hours a day for 5 days a week. Multiplying these gives 8 * 5 = 40 hours per week.

Then, we multiply his new hourly wage by the number of hours he works in a week to get his total weekly earnings. So, 12 * 40 = 480.

